.vercel
.env*

# Generated by the "vercel-build" script (esbuild bundles src/app.ts, with
# the @edusheets/* workspace TS packages inlined) -- never hand-edit or
# commit this, it's regenerated fresh on every Vercel build. The committed
# api/index.mjs is a one-line entry that re-exports it.
build/
# Static-output dir Vercel requires (non-empty) for a framework-less
# project; vercel-build creates it holding just a robots.txt.
public/
